{
  "uid": "flagship-canary",
  "title": "Canary: old vs new",
  "description": "During a canary, two revisions answer the store's URL. Who gets the traffic, and is the new one worse?",
  "tags": [
    "flagship",
    "canary"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Flagship dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "flagship"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "During `make canary PCT=10`, two **revisions** of the store answer the same URL. Each line is one revision\n(`flagship-000NN-xyz`; `make status` says which is `stable` and which is `canary`). Compare them:\n**share of requests** (did the split happen?), **errors** and **latency** (is the new one worse?).\nSame or better → `make promote`. Worse → `make rollback`. Cloud Run reports these numbers itself, about a minute behind.\n"
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Share of requests, by revision",
      "description": "Each revision's share of the store's requests. A 10% canary is a thin band on top.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "2m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "sum by (revision_name) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\"}[$__interval]))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 600000,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "percent",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.revision_name}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests per second, by revision",
      "description": "All requests to the store, including the bots and Schemathesis.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "2m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "sum by (revision_name) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\"}[$__interval]))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 600000,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.revision_name}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors (5xx), % of each revision's requests",
      "description": "A broken canary shows up here first. Under 1% is green; over 5% is red.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "2m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "100 * (sum by (revision_name) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\",response_code_class=\"5xx\"}[$__interval])) or 0 * sum by (revision_name) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\"}[$__interval]))) / sum by (revision_name) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\"}[$__interval]))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 600000,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.revision_name}",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 latency, by revision",
      "description": "95% of requests were faster than this. A canary that's slower than stable is worse, even with no errors.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "2m",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (revision_name, le) (rate(run_googleapis_com:request_latencies_bucket{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship\"}[$__interval])))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 6,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "insertNulls": 600000,
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.revision_name}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
